    "description": {
      "value": "A maestro's instrument can be crafted in the form of any variety of handheld musical instrument. A maestro's instrument grants you a +1 item bonus to Performance checks while playing music with the instrument.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou play the instrument, causing it to cast a DC 17 charm spell.\n\nThe item bonus is +3, and the charm spell is 8th level (DC 38)."
